<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx1.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In Limitations ‣ Distributional Semantics Tracing: A Framework for Explaining Hallucinations in Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Abstraction risk and causal isolation.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx1.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In Limitations ‣ Distributional Semantics Tracing: A Framework for Explaining Hallucinations in Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Implications.</span></a></li>
