<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Performance comparison of eleven explainability techniques, ranging from traditional attention analysis to advanced causal-tracing and ensemble methods, measured by faithfulness scores on the Racing Thoughts benchmark across four compact language models. Our method, <span id="S3.T1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Distributional Semantics Tracing</span>, achieves the highest average faithfulness score (0.71), substantially outperforming all baseline, advanced, and ensemble methods.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S3.T2" class="ltx_table">
<div id="S3.T2.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:238.2pt;vertical-align:-117.3pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-64.4pt,44.5pt) scale(0.728059764096853,0.728059764096853) ;">
<table id="S3.T2.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
